{{TAG:0003:0026:}}So. This job? Decided to stick it
out. Make it work. Make a go of it.
So glad I did!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Antes solía cambiar mucho de
trabajo. Las niñas eran aún muy
pequeñas. Era lo que tocaba{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Finalmente conseguí este puesto.
Y decidí conservarlo. La mejor
decisión de mi vida.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sai, quando le mie figlie erano
piccole cambiavo spesso lavoro.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Era stressante per la famiglia{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ma con questa attività
ho tenuto duro. E sono
riuscito a farla decollare!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Heh heh. Well. When the girls were
younger? Didn't care to hear that.
Didn't want to look like the ol' man!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Said they wanted to look like little
thems. Not little mes. Guess ol'
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Lyle{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} can understand that{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}But now? We all look back on those
days and laugh. Laugh out loud.
Laugh together! Good times. Boom.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Je, je. ¿"Las niñas eran aún muy
pequeñas"? Madre mía. Eso me ha
hecho sonar como un vejestorio.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Recuerdo que querían parecerse
a su madre. No a mí. Lo cual no es
difícil de entender, por otra parte{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ahora echo la vista atrás y me río.
¡Qué remedio! Eran buenos tiempos.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Quando le mie figlie erano piccole,
non erano contente di sentirsi
dire che mi assomigliavano!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Dicevano che volevano somigliare
alla mamma, non al vecchio {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Frodolo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ora quando ripensiamo a quei
tempi, ridiamo un sacco. {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Ah, i bei tempi andati...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Höhö!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Fand sie früher ganz
